---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Sundays | Lifepoint Church - Moreton, Queensland
description: Sundays at Lifepoint Church, Rothwell. Services at 8.30am, 10am and 5pm. Come as you are.
permalink: /sundays/
heroHeader: true
ticker:
  - Come as you are
  - Free barista coffee for first timers
  - Kids Crew every term Sunday
  - 65 minutes
  - All ages welcome
  - Grace Lutheran College, Rothwell
ages:
  - { label: Kids, img: sundays-age-kids }
  - { label: Teens, img: sundays-age-teens }
  - { label: Babies, img: sundays-age-babies }
  - { label: Families, img: sundays-age-families }
  - { label: Young adults, img: sundays-age-young-adults }
  - { label: Seniors, img: sundays-age-seniors }
steps:
  - { title: Arrive, img: sundays-step-arrive, text: "Aim for about 10 minutes early. Park free beside the Chapel and look for our welcome team at the door." }
  - { title: If you have kids, img: sundays-step-kids, text: "Our Next Gen team will get your children checked in and settled, then show you where to pick them up." }
  - { title: Gather, img: sundays-step-gather, text: "We sing, pray and hear a message from the Bible. The whole service runs for about 65 minutes." }
  - { title: Stay for a coffee, img: sundays-step-coffee, text: "If it's your first time, your barista coffee is on us. It's the easiest way to meet a few people." }
practical:
  - { title: Free parking, text: "Right beside the Chapel." }
  - { title: Accessible site, text: "Our site is accessible, with disability parking available." }
  - { title: "Parents' room", text: "A quiet space if you need it with your little one." }
  - { title: No dress code, text: "Wear whatever you're comfortable in. Most people dress like they're heading to the shops." }
faqs:
  - q: Do I have to be a Christian to come?
    a: "Not at all. Every Sunday we have people who wouldn't call themselves Christian or religious. You're welcome to come, look around and ask questions."
  - q: What happens to my kids?
    a: "At the 8.30am and 10am services we run Tots, Kids Crew Jnr and Kids Crew during school terms. In school holidays kids join their families in the service. Check-in is in the foyer, or <a href=\"https://lifepointchurchrothwell.churchsuite.com/-/forms/wsa5alxz\">pre-register online</a> to skip the forms."
  - q: How long is a service?
    a: "About 65 minutes. We sing, pray together, hear what's happening around the church and listen to a message from the Bible of around 25 minutes."
  - q: Will I have to do anything?
    a: "Only what you're comfortable with. We'll stand for some songs and prayers and it will always be clear when, but you're free to sit and take it in."
  - q: Do I have to give money?
    a: "No. Giving is for people who call Lifepoint home. As a guest, please don't feel any expectation."
  - q: Do you have communion?
    a: "Yes, every four weeks. Communion, also called the Lord's Supper, is when we share bread and juice to remember Jesus' death for us. Anyone who wants to receive God's grace is welcome to take part, and you're equally welcome to sit it out."
  - q: Morning or 5pm?
    a: "They're very similar, with the same message and music. The main difference is that kids programs only run in the morning."
  - q: How do I find the building?
    a: "We meet in the Chapel at Grace Lutheran College, Rothwell. Turn off Anzac Ave into Mewes Rd. The Chapel is the large building first on your left, so turn into the first carpark and you'll see it. There are signs on Sundays too."
beyond:
  - { title: Watch online, url: "/watch--listen/", text: "Catch up on recent messages any time, wherever you are." }
  - { title: Try Alpha, url: "/alpha/", text: "Food, a short talk and honest conversation about life and faith. Questions welcome." }
  - { title: Next Steps, url: "/next-steps/", text: "Been coming for a little while? Find out more about Lifepoint and how to get connected." }
---
{% import "macros.njk" as m with context %}

<section class="hero">
  {{ m.photo("sundays-hero", "hero__img", true) }}
  <div class="hero__inner">
    {{ m.eyebrow("Lifepoint Church · Rothwell") }}
    <h1 class="hero__title">Sundays <span class="script">at</span> Lifepoint</h1>
    <div class="hero__foot">
      <p class="hero__intro">Whether church is familiar or brand new to you, there's a seat saved for you. Come as you are.</p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <ul class="times">{% for t in site.timesList %}<li>{{ t }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
        {{ m.pill("Plan your visit", site.planVisit) }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="ticker" aria-label="{{ ticker | join(', ') }}">
  <div class="ticker__track" aria-hidden="true">
    {% for round in [1, 2] %}{% for t in ticker %}<span>{{ t }} ✦</span>{% endfor %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="split-head">
    <div>
      {{ m.eyebrow("Every generation") }}
      <h2>One family, every age.</h2>
    </div>
    <p>We're a multigenerational church. On any Sunday you'll see babies and kids, teenagers, young families, single and married adults, and seniors. Everyone has a place here.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="ages">
    {% for a in ages %}
    <figure class="age">{{ m.photo(a.img, "age__img") }}<figcaption>{{ a.label }}</figcaption></figure>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--linen">
  <div class="centre-head">
    {{ m.eyebrow("Our campuses") }}
    <h2>Find your Sunday.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="campuses">
    <article class="campus">
      {{ m.photo("campus-rothwell", "campus__img") }}
      <div class="campus__body">
        <h3>Rothwell</h3>
        <p class="campus__times">Sundays 8.30am · 10am · 5pm</p>
        <p>Grace Lutheran College Chapel, Mewes Rd. Turn off Anzac Ave into Mewes Rd and the Chapel is the first building on your left. Kids and Tots run at 8.30am and 10am during school terms.</p>
        <p class="links">
          <a class="arrow-link" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/oXXmhAjeQpa4oXQ79">Get directions <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="arrow-link" href="https://maps.apple.com/?address=Anzac%20Ave,%20Rothwell%20QLD%204022,%20Australia&amp;auid=14105778176731285847&amp;ll=-27.218671,153.057131&amp;q=Grace%20Lutheran%20College%20-%20Rothwell%20Campus">Apple Maps <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="campus">
      <div class="campus__media">
        {{ m.photo("campus-caboolture-west", "campus__img") }}
        <p class="badge"><span>Launching</span> 7 Feb 2027</p>
      </div>
      <div class="campus__body">
        <h3>Caboolture West</h3>
        <p class="campus__times">Service time coming soon</p>
        <p>Grace College Caboolture. A new Lifepoint campus for the growing communities of Caboolture West. Be part of it from day one.</p>
        <p class="links"><a class="arrow-link" href="{{ '/waraba/' | url }}">Find out more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="centre-head">
    {{ m.eyebrow("Your first Sunday") }}
    <h2>Here's how it flows.</h2>
  </div>
  <ol class="steps">
    {% for s in steps %}
    <li class="step">
      <div class="step__media">{{ m.photo(s.img, "step__img") }}<span class="step__num">0{{ loop.index }}</span></div>
      <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ s.text }}</p>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--linen welcome">
  <div class="welcome__media">
    {{ m.photo("sundays-dan", "welcome__img") }}
    <svg class="welcome__badge" viewBox="0 0 120 120" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs><path id="circ" d="M60,60 m-46,0 a46,46 0 1,1 92,0 a46,46 0 1,1 -92,0"/></defs>
      <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="58" />
      <text><textPath href="#circ">WELCOME HOME · COME AS YOU ARE ·</textPath></text>
      <text class="hi" x="60" y="68" text-anchor="middle">hi!</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="welcome__text">
    {{ m.eyebrow("A welcome from Dan") }}
    <blockquote>"You don't need to know the songs, own a Bible or have it all worked out. Just come. We'd love to meet you."</blockquote>
    <p>Walking into a church for the first time can feel like a big step. I get that. Every week we have people with us who are just checking things out, people coming back after a long break, and people who've followed Jesus for decades.</p>
    <p class="sig"><span class="script">Dan Sweetman</span><span>Senior Pastor</span></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec plan">
  {{ m.photo("sundays-plan-visit", "plan__img") }}
  <div class="plan__text">
    {{ m.eyebrow("Plan your visit") }}
    <h2>Let us know you're coming.</h2>
    <ul class="ticks">
      <li>Someone to meet you at the door</li>
      <li>Help getting your kids settled</li>
      <li>A free barista coffee on us</li>
    </ul>
    {{ m.pill("Plan your visit", site.planVisit, "dark") }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--nextgen kids">
  <div class="kids__text">
    {{ m.eyebrow("Lifepoint Kids") }}
    <h2>Your kids will love it here.</h2>
    <dl class="groups">
      <div><dt>Tots</dt><dd>18 months to Kindy age</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Kids Crew Jnr</dt><dd>Kindy and Prep</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Kids Crew</dt><dd>Years 1 to 6</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <ul class="stars">
      <li>Runs at the 8.30am and 10am services during school terms</li>
      <li>In school holidays kids join their families in the service</li>
      <li>No kids program at 5pm, so kids stay with you</li>
      <li>Every leader holds a Blue Card and completes child-safe training</li>
    </ul>
    {{ m.pill("Pre-register your kids", site.kidsRego, "dark") }}
  </div>
  <div class="kids__collage">
    {{ m.photo("sundays-kids-1", "collage__img") }}
    {{ m.photo("sundays-kids-2", "collage__img") }}
    {{ m.photo("sundays-kids-3", "collage__img") }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="centre-head">
    {{ m.eyebrow("Good to know") }}
    <h2>The practical stuff.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="cards">
    {% for c in practical %}<div class="card"><h3>{{ c.title }}</h3><p>{{ c.text }}</p></div>{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--linen faq">
  <div class="faq__head">
    {{ m.eyebrow("Got questions?") }}
    <h2>Good questions.</h2>
    <p>Still wondering about something? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> or call <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneLink }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>. A real person will get back to you.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq__list">
    {% for f in faqs %}
    <details><summary>{{ f.q }}</summary><p>{{ f.a | safe }}</p></details>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--dark beyond">
  {{ m.photo("sundays-beyond-bg", "beyond__bg") }}
  <div class="centre-head">
    {{ m.eyebrow("Beyond Sunday") }}
    <h2>Can't make it? Want more?</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="beyond__cards">
    {% for b in beyond %}
    <a class="lcard" href="{{ b.url | url }}"><h3>{{ b.title }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></h3><p>{{ b.text }}</p></a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec closing">
  {{ m.eyebrow("See you Sunday") }}
  <h2>Your seat<br><span class="script">is saved.</span></h2>
  {{ m.pill("Plan your visit", site.planVisit, "dark") }}
  <p class="closing__line">Grace Lutheran College Chapel, Mewes Rd, Rothwell · Sundays 8.30am, 10am &amp; 5pm</p>
</section>
